    "PLO4"
   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:107%\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Inspect the impact of Open Source Operating Systems on technological innovation, enterprise adoption, and community-driven development. Discuss the benefits, challenges, and future prospects of open-source OS in modern computing environments.</span></span></span></b></p>\n",
